@baseUrl = https://your-app.test
@token = your-bearer-token

### Upsert homepage SEO (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/content/page-seo/homepage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TitleAr": "تعاريف العقارية | الرئيسية",
  "TitleEn": "Taearif | Homepage",
  "DescriptionAr": "أفضل العقارات للبيع والإيجار",
  "DescriptionEn": "Best properties for sale and rent",
  "og:image": "https://cdn.example.com/og-home.jpg",
  "og:type": "website"
}

### Partial update (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/content/page-seo/for-rent
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "TitleAr": "عقارات للإيجار"
}

### Upsert via POST (by path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/content/page-seo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "/my-custom-page",
  "TitleAr": "صفحة مخصصة",
  "TitleEn": "Custom Page",
  "DescriptionAr": "وصف الصفحة"
}
